Theoretically.

613
00:46:27.583 --> 00:46:30.167
Theoretically? Yes. that's possible. Yes.

614
00:46:31.167 --> 00:46:34.333
So. could you suppress
only some parts of that DNA expression?

615
00:46:34.500 --> 00:46:37.083
Like the bad aspects
but just keep all of the good stuff?

616
00:46:37.917 --> 00:46:40.917
You mean. like. if I wanted to keep
some parts of Hulk but not others?

617
00:46:41.167 --> 00:46:42.250
Right.

618
