-Hey. hey. hey.
-MJ! I'm sorry. but you're in danger.

744
00:55:00.167 --> 00:55:01.083
-Where's your roommate?
-What?

745
00:55:01.417 --> 00:55:02.000
Where's Ned?

746
00:55:02.250 --> 00:55:03.417
In Boston with friends. Why?

747
00:55:03.583 --> 00:55:04.750
Okay. good. You gotta come with me.

748
00:55:05.000 --> 00:55:06.417
What? I don't know
if you're the real Spider-Man.

749
00:55:06.667 --> 00:55:08.083
-I'm not coming with you.
-We don't have time for this.

750
00:55:08.333 --> 00:55:10.417
-Please. Come on.
-You need to get out of my apartment.

751
00:55:10.583 --> 00:55:11.750
Look. this is gonna sound insane...

752
00:55:11.917 --> 00:55:14.333
