who is really dangerous. okay?

753
00:55:14.500 --> 00:55:16.250
And I promised you
that I would keep you safe.

754
00:55:17.417 --> 00:55:19.333
Please. you just have to trust me. Come on.

755
00:55:22.833 --> 00:55:23.833
Fine.

756
00:55:30.583 --> 00:55:31.583
Web. Stop.

757
00:55:35.333 --> 00:55:36.250
Web. Stop.

758
00:55:40.417 --> 00:55:41.417
Web stop.

759
00:55:47.083 --> 00:55:48.333
-Are you okay?
-Yeah. yeah. I'm fine.

760
00:55:48.500 --> 00:55:50.917
Okay. We should be safe up here.

761
00:55:51.083 --> 00:55:52.167
Okay. well. safe from what?

762
00:55:53.583 --> 00:55:54.833
I'm not entirely sure.

763
00:55:55.083 --> 00:55:56.417
Okay. well. what do they want with me?

764
00:55:57.250 --> 00:55:58.833
-I don't know.
-You don't know?

765
00:55:59.583 --> 00:56:01.917
It doesn't make any sense.
Why would they choose me?

766
00:56:02.083 --> 00:56:04.417
I wish I could tell you. I just...

767
00:56:07.500 --> 00:56:09.000
We knew each other. didn't we?

768
00:56:12.750 --> 00:56:13.667
What?

769
00:56:14.667 --> 00:56:16.000
It's the only explanation.

770
00:56:17.333 --> 00:56:18.583
It's been driving me crazy for years...

771
00:56:18.833 --> 00:56:21.167
all the times that Spider-Man
saved either me or Ned.

772
00:56:21.917 --> 00:56:22.833
It was the Washington Monument...

773
00:56:23.083 --> 00:56:25.583
and then it was London and Prague
and the Night Monkey.

774
00:56:26.500 --> 00:56:28.917
I mean. twice is a coincidence.
but over and over again...

775
00:56:31.333 --> 00:56:33.000
We knew each other. Tell me I'm wrong.

776
00:56:36.250 --> 00:56:39.000
What were we?
Were we classmates or friends or something?

777
00:56:39.667 --> 00:56:41.833
Look. I don't know what you're talking about.

778
00:56:42.083 --> 00:56:43.167
Were we something more?

779
00:56:45.417 --> 00:56:47.667
I just. I can't. I can't remember.

780
00:56:47.833 --> 00:56:49.583
And I feel like someone scrambled my brain.

781
00:56:49.917 --> 00:56:51.750
And you're the only one who would know why.

782
00:56:52.917 --> 00:56:54.083
This is crazy. I can't...

783
00:56:54.250 --> 00:56:56.167
I know that you can't
tell me the truth.

784
00:56:59.167 --> 00:57:00.333
But I need to know.

785
00:57:05.583 --> 00:57:07.500
Maybe there's a part of me
that still remembers.

786
00:57:51.167 --> 00:57:52.167
MJ.

787
00:57:52.333 --> 00:57:53.417
Hey. Peter.

788
00:57:59.917 --> 00:58:01.333
I've missed you so much.

789
00:58:06.333 --> 00:58:08.000
I can't believe you figured it out.

790
00:58:08.500 --> 00:58:09.500
I did.

791
00:58:15.250 --> 00:58:17.667
Go ahead. Peter. Touch her.

792
00:58:19.167 --> 00:58:20.417
Hold her.

793
00:58:21.833 --> 00:58:23.250
You've been wanting to for so long.

794
00:58:32.167 --> 00:58:33.750
True love's kiss breaks the spell...

795
00:58:34.667 --> 00:58:36.500
and reunites the star-crossed lovers.

796
00:58:38.750 --> 00:58:39.917
MJ would vomit.

797
00:58:42.667 --> 00:58:44.250
You really are a simple spider. aren't you?

798
00:58:47.917 --> 00:58:48.750
I see why you like her.

799
00:58:49.500 --> 00:58:50.500
She's...

800
00:58:51.750 --> 00:58:53.167
she's smart...

801
00:58:53.667 --> 00:58:54.667
funny...

802
00:58:55.583 --> 00:58:56.833
and a little dark and twisted.

803
00:59:00.917 --> 00:59:02.000
I mean. it is sad.

804
00:59:03.167 --> 00:59:06.250
There is. like. no thoughts of you in here...

805
00:59:07.667 --> 00:59:08.833
whatsoever.

806
00:59:10.417 --> 00:59:11.667
But you knew that. didn't you?

807
00:59:13.083 --> 00:59:14.417
You're a monster.

808
00:59:15.333 --> 00:59:17.000
If you loved someone 
the way that I love her...

809
00:59:17.250 --> 00:59:19.917
then you'd know that
what you're doing right now is unforgivable.

810
00:59:20.083 --> 00:59:21.167
Is that so?

811
00:59:28.167 --> 00:59:31.167
You know. some people would kill
to hold the person they love one last time

812
00:59:33.167 --> 00:59:34.500
Stop it now.

813
00:59:44.333 --> 00:59:45.667
You're running out of time. Peter.

814
00:59:46.833 --> 00:59:50.333
Soon enough. it won't just be your friends
who don't remember Peter Parker.

815
00:59:51.833 --> 00:59:53.500
Maybe you should write a letter to yourself.

816
00:59:58.167 --> 00:59:59.167
Get out of her.

817
01:00:00.750 --> 01:00:02.083
Who's the monster now. Peter?

818
01:00:25.500 --> 01:00:26.417
MJ.

819
01:00:27.083 --> 01:00:29.333
MJ. No. no. no. Oh. God.

820
01:00:29.500 --> 01:00:31.000
Oh. God. please. no. come on.

821
01:00:31.250 --> 01:00:32.750
Come on. come on. come on.

822
01:00:33.000 --> 01:00:35.417
Oh. thank God. Oh. thank God.

823
01:00:35.583 --> 01:00:38.417
Oh. you're okay. Oh. you're okay.

824
01:00:38.583 --> 01:00:39.833
Oh. I'm so sorry.

825
01:00:42.333 --> 01:00:44.417
Stop. Wait. wait. stop. stop.
please. I'll quit.

826
01:00:44.667 --> 01:00:46.750
You win. you win. you win.
Just don't hurt her.

827
01:00:49.833 --> 01:00:51.250
You're a mess. Spider-Man.

828
01:00:54.000 --> 01:00:55.417
Anytime I want...

829
01:00:55.583 --> 01:00:56.917
I can be anyone I want.

830
01:00:58.167 --> 01:00:59.917
So you can't protect MJ...

831
01:01:01.333 --> 01:01:02.917
even from herself.

832
01:01:10.333 --> 01:01:11.750
It really is a nice letter.

833
01:01:12.750 --> 01:01:13.750
Little heavy-handed.

834
01:01:14.000 --> 01:01:15.000
But not bad.

835
01:01:34.000 --> 01:01:36.417
You're okay.
I'm gonna take you someplace safe.

836
01:01:36.667 --> 01:01:37.583
What?

837
01:01:39.000 --> 01:01:40.083
Take me to 3165...

838
01:01:40.333 --> 01:01:41.417
Lafayette Street.

839
01:01:41.667 --> 01:01:44.000
Navigating to Empire State University.

840
01:01:49.000 --> 01:01:50.250
Wait. wait. wait! Okay.

841
01:01:52.500 --> 01:01:53.583
-I got you. I got you.
-Are you sure?

842
01:01:53.750 --> 01:01:54.583
-Yep.
-Okay.

843
01:01:54.750 --> 01:01:55.833
'Cause I feel like
I'm slipping a little bit.

844
01:01:56.000 --> 01:01:56.917
-You're not slipping.
-Okay.

845
01:01:58.917 --> 01:02:00.000
You're okay. you're okay. you're okay.

846
01:02:00.250 --> 01:02:01.833
Yeah. yeah. yeah. I'm fine. I'm fine.

847
01:02:05.500 --> 01:02:06.167
Okay.

848
01:02:06.417 --> 01:02:07.417
Can we just slow down...

849
01:02:07.667 --> 01:02:08.917
-for like two seconds. please?
-Well. we're almost there.

850
01:02:09.167 --> 01:02:11.250
Yeah. yeah. but you just told me
I was mind controlled.

851
01:02:11.417 --> 01:02:12.333
Well. not technically.

852
01:02:12.500 --> 01:02:13.583
I mean. you're lucky
I believe in that stuff. okay?

853
01:02:13.750 --> 01:02:15.833
Because governments have been doing it
for years. especially the French.

854
01:02:16.583 --> 01:02:17.667
-Are you okay?
-Yeah...

855
01:02:17.917 --> 01:02:20.250
Look. Sorry. I'm just trying
to take you someplace safe. okay?

856
01:02:24.917 --> 01:02:26.167
I don't feel safe.

857
01:02:28.250 --> 01:02:29.083
Oh. shit.

858
01:02:34.250 --> 01:02:35.417
-Sorry.
-Oh. watch out!

859
01:02:45.000 --> 01:02:46.250
You're losing it. kid.

860
01:02:46.667 --> 01:02:49.083
Thought you'd be able to see that coming
a mile away.

861
01:02:49.250 --> 01:02:50.250
What is wrong with you?

862
01:02:50.417 --> 01:02:51.667
-You could've killed us.
-Excuse me.

863
01:02:52.083 --> 01:02:54.583
You show up to my house unannounced.
what do you think's gonna happen?

864
01:02:54.750 --> 01:02:55.583
Wait. this is your house?

865
01:02:55.833 --> 01:02:56.833
-No. no. Don't. don't. don't.
-Who the hell is that?

866
01:02:57.333 --> 01:02:58.250
Who the hell are you?

867
01:02:59.000 --> 01:02:59.917
She's...

868
01:03:01.000 --> 01:03:01.917
You know.

869
01:03:02.167 --> 01:03:04.083
No. I don't know.
That's why I just asked you.

870
01:03:04.333 --> 01:03:06.917
She's in danger. Frank.
Look. I need your help. okay?

871
01:03:07.083 --> 01:03:09.083
-Yeah. looks like it.
-Well. come on. You owe me.

872
01:03:09.750 --> 01:03:12.083
-For... Aren't you sick of this story?
-Staten Island!

873
01:03:12.333 --> 01:03:13.667
Nah. Staten Island.

874
01:03:13.833 --> 01:03:16.167
What more do you want me to do?
I literally saved your life.

875
01:03:16.417 --> 01:03:17.250
You're out of your mind. kid!

876
01:03:17.417 --> 01:03:18.333
What. I gotta save it twice...

877
01:03:18.500 --> 01:03:19.583
-to get a favor out of you?
-That guy couldn't hit me...

878
01:03:19.833 --> 01:03:21.917
-with a handful of rice.
-I mean. what does that sound like to you?

879
01:03:22.083 --> 01:03:23.167
-I had him exactly where I want him.
-A drug dealer was gonna shoot a guy...

880
01:03:23.333 --> 01:03:24.500
-I'm seein' him right there.
-...then I webbed the gun...

881
01:03:24.667 --> 01:03:25.833
-...out of the drug dealer's hand...
-I know exactly what I'm...

882
01:03:26.000 --> 01:03:27.167
-...completely up for.
-...and then kicked that drug dealer...

883
01:03:27.333 --> 01:03:28.167
-Okay. fine. go ahead.
-...back into a storage container.

884
01:03:28.417 --> 01:03:29.750
-What would you call that?
-What does that sound like to you?

885
01:03:31.083 --> 01:03:32.167
I don't care. I just wanna go home.

886
01:03:33.167 --> 01:03:35.250
That's an excellent idea. Kick rocks.

887
01:03:35.417 --> 01:03:37.083
-Go home.
-No. wait. wait. Frank. Frank. Frank. wait.

888
01:03:37.250 --> 01:03:38.083
Please.

889
01:03:39.250 --> 01:03:42.917
I have got to keep her safe. okay?
And I don't have anywhere else to go.

890
01:03:46.833 --> 01:03:47.833
You like chili?

891
01:03:49.167 --> 01:03:50.083
I made chili.

892
01:03:51.917 --> 01:03:52.833
All right. Just...

893
01:03:53.750 --> 01:03:54.833
watch out for the claymores.

894
01:03:55.083 --> 01:03:57.500
Don't wanna pick up pieces of you 
for the next two weeks.

895
01:03:59.000 --> 01:04:01.000
Hey. I definitely would not eat that chili.

896
01:04:02.917 --> 01:04:04.583
So. you telling me that maniac...

897
01:04:04.833 --> 01:04:08.000
behind all that tank nonsense
is nothing but a goddamn teenager?

898
01:04:08.250 --> 01:04:11.833
And it's not just the tank. it's every attack
on Damage Control this past month.

899
01:04:12.083 --> 01:04:13.833
And how does a kid learn how to drive a tank?

900
01:04:14.083 --> 01:04:15.083
I don't know. Frank.

901
01:04:15.333 --> 01:04:18.250
-Beat you all over the street like that.
-She did not beat me.

902
01:04:19.250 --> 01:04:20.333
This your family?

903
01:04:23.333 --> 01:04:25.083
Would you get the hell away from that?

904
01:04:25.833 --> 01:04:27.917
Look. I got one rule in this house.

905
01:04:28.083 --> 01:04:30.750
You don't touch anything.
You don't move anything.

906
01:04:30.917 --> 01:04:33.917
You sure as shit don't ask me
any goddamn questions about anything.

907
01:05:13.417 --> 01:05:14.167
But she's classified as a telepath. 
And now we have a name.

908
01:05:18.333 --> 01:05:19.250
"Jean Grey."

909
01:05:21.250 --> 01:05:24.917
Yeah. These are the Damage Control sites
that she hasn't hit yet...

910
01:05:25.083 --> 01:05:26.333
so if she surfaces...

911
01:05:26.583 --> 01:05:28.500
then my facial tracking program
will pick her up.

912
01:05:30.750 --> 01:05:32.083
Oh. yeah? What then?

913
01:05:34.500 --> 01:05:37.167
Well. don't worry about "what then."
Just look after her.

914
01:05:37.333 --> 01:05:38.750
Don't worry about it. huh?

915
01:05:38.917 --> 01:05:40.750
I'm just supposed to sit here and
babysit your girlfriend?

916
01:05:40.917 --> 01:05:42.583
-I don't need to be babysat. so yeah.
-She's not my girlfriend.

917
01:05:42.833 --> 01:05:44.833
All right. all right.
Look. what's the plan. huh?

918
01:05:45.083 --> 01:05:48.500
Just gonna hope that
your facial tracking program works?

919
01:05:48.667 --> 01:05:50.833
And you get yourself killed.
I gotta watch her the rest of my life?

920
01:05:51.000 --> 01:05:53.250
I'm not gonna get killed. Frank.
I can catch her. okay?

921
01:05:53.417 --> 01:05:54.250
I just...

922
01:05:54.417 --> 01:05:56.917
I just have to fix my inhibitor
and then I'll be good to go.

923
01:05:57.500 --> 01:05:58.917
Well. what do you need to do that?

924
01:06:00.250 --> 01:06:03.833
Frank. You do not have
what I need to do that. okay?

925
01:06:05.333 --> 01:06:06.667
You know you've got some mouth on you.

926
01:06:06.833 --> 01:06:08.667
What do you think.
you have an anti-static mat...

927
01:06:08.833 --> 01:06:10.500
a tonal probe. and micro tools?

928
01:06:11.167 --> 01:06:12.583
I got all that shit.

929
01:06:13.167 --> 01:06:14.167
What for?

930
01:06:14.333 --> 01:06:15.750
-Bombs.
-Bingo.

931
01:06:18.167 --> 01:06:19.167
Unbelievable.

932
01:06:31.083 --> 01:06:33.250
Hey. do you think it's safe
to maybe call someone...

933
01:06:33.417 --> 01:06:35.083
and let them know I'm okay?

934
01:06:39.500 --> 01:06:40.500
Like your boyfriend?

935
01:06:41.750 --> 01:06:44.000
No. Like my roommate.

936
01:06:48.083 --> 01:06:50.500
I don't think that's such a good idea.
you know. because...

937
01:06:51.583 --> 01:06:54.917
she already knows who he is.
and she can inhabit anyone she wants. so...

938
01:06:55.083 --> 01:06:56.083
Right. Yeah.

939
01:06:56.250 --> 01:06:57.583
Yeah. yeah. yeah. You're right.

940
01:06:57.750 --> 01:07:00.250
-Sorry.
-No. it's fine. I totally get it.

941
01:07:02.417 --> 01:07:03.583
If I called my boyfriend...

942
01:07:04.667 --> 01:07:06.750
he'd just ask me a bunch of questions
that I couldn't answer...

943
01:07:06.917 --> 01:07:10.250
and then he'd tell me
I was being withholding again.

944
01:07:10.417 --> 01:07:12.167
-Withholding?
-Yep.

945
01:07:12.417 --> 01:07:14.250
Sounds like your boyfriend's kind of a jerk.

946
01:07:17.083 --> 01:07:18.250
But why'd he think you're withholding?

947
01:07:19.167 --> 01:07:23.083
I don't know. You tell me.
masked vigilante behind the curtain.

948
01:07:25.333 --> 01:07:27.000
Okay. I see your point.

949
01:07:29.000 --> 01:07:30.083
So what about you?

950
01:07:30.667 --> 01:07:31.667
What about me?

951
01:07:32.667 --> 01:07:35.917
Well. do you have a Mrs. Spider-Man?

952
01:07:38.000 --> 01:07:39.750
Do I have a Mrs. Spider-Man?

953
01:07:43.833 --> 01:07:45.417
No. No.

954
01:07:46.500 --> 01:07:47.500
Why not?

955
01:07:47.667 --> 01:07:49.333
Why not? Because I'm...

956
01:07:51.083 --> 01:07:53.083
I'm too withholding. obviously.

957
01:07:54.000 --> 01:07:55.083
Welcome to the club.

958
01:08:02.083 --> 01:08:03.167
There was someone.

959
01:08:04.500 --> 01:08:05.833
-Really?
-Yeah. yeah. yeah.

960
01:08:08.917 --> 01:08:10.000
What happened?

961
01:08:13.417 --> 01:08:14.833
I had to let her go.

962
01:08:16.167 --> 01:08:17.250
To keep her safe.

963
01:08:21.583 --> 01:08:23.583
I'm sorry.
That must have been really hard for you.

964
01:08:25.000 --> 01:08:26.917
Yeah. it was. Yeah. It is.

965
01:08:28.333 --> 01:08:29.167
It is really hard.

966
01:08:33.500 --> 01:08:34.500
Are you okay?

967
01:08:34.667 --> 01:08:35.667
Yeah. Yeah. yeah. I'm okay. I...

968
01:08:35.833 --> 01:08:37.167
You know what. I'm just gonna come over.

969
01:08:37.333 --> 01:08:38.917
Hold on. hold on. hold on.

970
01:08:41.167 --> 01:08:42.000
What's going on?

971
01:08:42.167 --> 01:08:44.083
It just keeps overheating on me.

972
01:08:44.917 --> 01:08:46.583
It's been stumping me for days.

973
01:08:47.333 --> 01:08:48.333
Before I switched to aerospace...

974
01:08:48.500 --> 01:08:52.333
I was gonna major in biochemical engineering.
so. do you mind if I...

975
01:08:52.583 --> 01:08:53.750
Oh. yeah. for sure.

976
01:08:54.000 --> 01:08:55.417
Here. There you go.

977
01:08:59.250 --> 01:09:00.167
Wow.

978
01:09:03.250 --> 01:09:05.167
So. does the device itself...

979
01:09:05.333 --> 01:09:09.083
I mean. does it generate
any kind of radiation or a magnetic field?

980
01:09:09.250 --> 01:09:10.500
'Cause that would definitely interfere.

981
01:09:10.667 --> 01:09:14.500
Yeah. it has a micro magnetic field.
but I accounted for that in the design.

982
01:09:14.667 --> 01:09:16.500
Okay. well. what about your suit?

983
01:09:16.667 --> 01:09:20.000
It actually dissipates into the fabric.
which is pretty cool.

984
01:09:20.917 --> 01:09:22.000
Okay.

985
01:09:25.000 --> 01:09:26.083
What about those?

986
01:09:27.250 --> 01:09:28.250
What about what?

987
01:09:30.833 --> 01:09:33.417
Your goggles. or whatever you call 'em.

988
01:09:34.083 --> 01:09:37.250
They would create a field.
It would be tiny. but...

989
01:09:38.750 --> 01:09:41.167
But it's on your head.
which is very close to the inhibitor.

990
01:09:41.333 --> 01:09:43.333
Which is probably why it's overheating.

991
01:09:43.583 --> 01:09:45.417
MJ. that is genius.

992
01:09:47.167 --> 01:09:48.417
Okay. this has to work.

993
01:09:52.500 --> 01:09:53.917
Inhibitor engaged.

994
01:09:55.417 --> 01:09:58.333
Suppressing selected arachnid hormones.

995
01:09:59.333 --> 01:10:01.250
Okay. That feels better.

996
01:10:01.417 --> 01:10:03.083
That feels totally better.

997
01:10:03.250 --> 01:10:04.917
My head feels so clear.

998
01:10:06.083 --> 01:10:07.167
Web. web.

999
01:10:07.417 --> 01:10:09.333
And I'm not shooting organic webs.

1000
01:10:09.583 --> 01:10:11.833
Oh. my God. MJ. that. like. totally worked.

1001
01:10:13.000 --> 01:10:15.417
You know. this is some really intense stuff
you're working on here.

1002
01:10:18.167 --> 01:10:19.917
Well. yeah. it's really important

1003
01:10:22.333 --> 01:10:26.000
Yeah. but this is like. I mean.
this is like altering your DNA.

1004
01:10:27.250 --> 01:10:30.667
I mean. this is the kind of stuff you put on.
like. I don't know. like a monster.

1005
01:10:32.917 --> 01:10:36.000
Well. if you've seen what's been happening
to me over the last couple days...

1006
01:10:36.167 --> 01:10:37.417
then you might understand.

1007
01:10:38.083 --> 01:10:39.417
Yeah. well. I've been with you
for the last few hours...

1008
01:10:39.583 --> 01:10:40.667
and that's not what I've seen.

1009
01:10:41.583 --> 01:10:42.583
And what have you seen?

1010
01:10:43.917 --> 01:10:45.083
From my side of the curtain?

1011
01:10:47.167 --> 01:10:50.583
A really good guy who might just be changing.

1012
01:10:55.750 --> 01:10:59.500
Well. I don't mean to overstep.
I'll let you get back to it.

1013
01:11:20.750 --> 01:11:22.083
Can't sleep either. huh?

1014
01:11:22.833 --> 01:11:23.833
You want coffee?

1015
01:11:27.000 --> 01:11:28.167
You get your shit fixed?

1016
01:11:29.167 --> 01:11:31.750
Yeah. I've been wearing it all night.

1017
01:11:31.917 --> 01:11:33.000
So far. so good.

1018
01:11:33.917 --> 01:11:35.583
I made this other one universal.

1019
01:11:35.750 --> 01:11:40.250
So if I could get it on Jean.
it should completely shut down her powers.

1020
01:11:41.167 --> 01:11:42.500
You know what else would work?

1021
01:11:42.833 --> 01:11:44.167
You just shoot her.

1022
01:11:44.417 --> 01:11:45.333
Nice.

1023
01:11:48.167 --> 01:11:49.333
Jesus Christ.

1024
01:11:50.750 --> 01:11:52.917
That has gotta be the goofiest shit
I ever seen in my life.

1025
01:11:53.083 --> 01:11:56.167
What. you can't even take the mask off
to drink a cup of coffee?

1026
01:11:57.417 --> 01:12:00.417
Don't take it personally. Frank.
It stays on for everybody.

1027
01:12:01.417 --> 01:12:02.500
Even her?

1028
01:12:04.917 --> 01:12:06.000
Who is she. kid?

1029
01:12:06.167 --> 01:12:07.167
I don't know.

1030
01:12:07.333 --> 01:12:09.167
That's horseshit. Who is she?

1031
01:12:09.333 --> 01:12:11.667
-I'm telling you. I don't know who she is.
-What are you doin'? You care about her.

1032
01:12:11.833 --> 01:12:12.917
-You're pretending not to. Why?
-I don't care about her.

1033
01:12:13.083 --> 01:12:14.833
Look. I don't know who she is. Frank. Okay?

1034
01:12:15.000 --> 01:12:17.667
I don't have anybody. I'm like you.
I just keep to myself.

1035
01:12:17.833 --> 01:12:18.917
You're like me?

1036
01:12:20.250 --> 01:12:21.583
What do you know about me. kid?

1037
01:12:22.583 --> 01:12:23.750
You think this is a choice?

1038
01:12:23.917 --> 01:12:26.500
Living like this. it's a lifestyle?
Is that what you think?

1039
01:12:27.167 --> 01:12:28.667
Kid. this is a sentence.

1040
01:12:29.833 --> 01:12:30.833
You know somethin'...

1041
01:12:31.667 --> 01:12:33.083
If I had one second...

1042
01:12:34.000 --> 01:12:37.167
people I love were still breathing.
you think I'd be hiding behind a mask?

1043
01:12:37.833 --> 01:12:39.917
You think I'd pretend
to be something that I'm not...

1044
01:12:40.083 --> 01:12:41.667
acting like a goddamn coward?

1045
01:12:47.583 --> 01:12:48.750
I got a facial match.

1046
01:12:52.917 --> 01:12:55.000
She's at the Damage Control HQ in Manhattan.

1047
01:12:55.250 --> 01:12:56.500
I gotta go. Okay.

1048
01:13:00.917 --> 01:13:02.833
She's gonna be okay.

1049
01:13:03.000 --> 01:13:04.167
I'll see to it.

1050
01:13:07.167 --> 01:13:08.333
Thanks. Frank.

1051
01:13:15.083 --> 01:13:17.667
Hey.

1052
01:13:19.333 --> 01:13:20.917
You just gonna let him go by himself?

1053
01:13:22.417 --> 01:13:23.750
You know. I think he might need you.

1054
01:13:26.667 --> 01:13:28.333
Kinda like you needed him on Staten Island.

1055
01:13:32.333 --> 01:13:33.333
Yeah.

1056
01:14:10.667 --> 01:14:12.667
You can't hide from me forever. Bill.

1057
01:14:13.583 --> 01:14:16.583
You've got a strong door.
but it's the wall you have to worry about.

1058
01:14:17.583 --> 01:14:19.167
Who are you and what do you want?

1059
01:14:24.417 --> 01:14:25.583
I'm Jean Grey...

1060
01:14:26.667 --> 01:14:28.333
and you know what I want.

1061
01:15:27.750 --> 01:15:29.000
Jean?

1062
01:15:29.500 --> 01:15:32.250
You looked me up? I'm blushing.

1063
01:15:33.417 --> 01:15:35.833
I told you what would happen to your girl
if you got in my way.

1064
01:15:36.750 --> 01:15:38.500
You're not getting near her again.

1065
01:15:39.333 --> 01:15:41.083
And you're definitely
not getting inside that vault.

1066
01:15:41.583 --> 01:15:42.583
Maybe not.

1067
01:15:50.083 --> 01:15:51.333
But this guy might.

1068
01:15:54.167 --> 01:15:56.750
Jean. you don't know
what you're dealing with.

1069
01:15:56.917 --> 01:15:59.583
You know you and Bar
have a lot in common

1070
01:15:59.833 --> 01:16:04.333
Both fighting a losing battle
against the monster that lives inside you.

1071
01:16:04.500 --> 01:16:06.250
Jean. this is the Hulk. you can't just...

1072
01:16:14.833 --> 01:16:15.917
What the hell?

1073
01:16:18.083 --> 01:16:19.250
I see.

1074
01:16:21.083 --> 01:16:24.417
Trying to muzzle me like you muzzle yourself?

1075
01:16:24.583 --> 01:16:26.000
I can't let you in there.

1076
01:16:26.167 --> 01:16:28.333
Whatever V-Max is. you're not getting it.

1077
01:16:28.750 --> 01:16:30.167
Like hell I'm not.

1078
01:16:30.750 --> 01:16:31.667
Oh. crap.

1079
01:16:43.917 --> 01:16:45.917
Jean. don't do this.

1080
01:16:46.417 --> 01:16:47.417
Save your breath.

1081
01:17:12.833 --> 01:17:14.583
Frank. what are you doing here?

1082
01:17:14.833 --> 01:17:16.417
What you think I'm doing?
I'm saving you.

1083
01:17:16.667 --> 01:17:18.417
This is way above your pay grade. dude.

1084
01:17:18.583 --> 01:17:19.917
-We're fighting the Hulk.
-Oh. shit!

1085
01:17:42.417 --> 01:17:43.417
Really?

1086
01:17:55.667 --> 01:17:56.833
Get out!

1087
01:18:03.250 --> 01:18:05.667
-Stop shooting him!
-Are you out of your goddamn mind?

1088
01:18:05.833 --> 01:18:08.083
He's... Banner's not the problem! She is.

1089
01:18:21.750 --> 01:18:23.333
I thought I told you to stay home
and watch MJ.

1090
01:18:23.500 --> 01:18:24.500
Yeah. you did.

1091
01:18:24.667 --> 01:18:26.500
And then she tells me I gotta come watch you.

1092
01:18:27.917 --> 01:18:29.333
Wait. did she actually say that to you?

1093
01:18:30.417 --> 01:18:31.583
Are you blushing. daffodil?

1094
01:18:32.583 --> 01:18:33.750
I'm not blushing.

1095
01:18:35.667 --> 01:18:38.250
Goddamn it. 
I knew I should have brought a bigger gun.

1096
01:18:38.417 --> 01:18:39.583
That's a good idea. "Bring a bigger gun."

1097
01:18:39.750 --> 01:18:40.583
What are you gonna do. tickle him to death?

1098
01:18:41.000 --> 01:18:42.250
No. Look. change of plan.

1099
01:18:42.417 --> 01:18:45.000
First we get this on the Hulk.
then we go after Jean.

1100
01:18:45.167 --> 01:18:46.250
I got one better.

1101
01:18:46.417 --> 01:18:48.250
That's the highest casualty-producing threat.

1102
01:18:48.417 --> 01:18:51.667
You contain it. I go find the source.
I take it down. You got it?

1103
01:18:52.250 --> 01:18:54.167
Are you just trying
to get out of fighting the Hulk?

1104
01:18:55.750 --> 01:18:57.167
-I guess so.
-Okay. whatever. dude.

1105
01:18:57.333 --> 01:18:58.250
I got this.

1106
01:18:58.917 --> 01:19:00.333
-Wait. no. Frank. Frank. Frank.
-What?

1107
01:19:00.750 --> 01:19:01.833
Do not kill her!

1108
01:19:02.000 --> 01:19:04.083
Don't start with that soft serve bullshit.

1109
01:19:04.333 --> 01:19:06.000
You know something?
I'm gonna do this. I'm gonna do it my way.

1110
01:19:06.250 --> 01:19:08.500
Just... just go. just go.

1111
01:19:08.667 --> 01:19:10.167
And don't get within 33 feet!

1112
01:19:11.000 --> 01:19:12.167
So frustrating.

1113
01:19:27.333 --> 01:19:28.167
Hey.

1114
01:19:34.083 --> 01:19:36.167
This guy's got issues.

1115
01:19:37.583 --> 01:19:40.417
No. Oh. no.

1116
01:19:44.083 --> 01:19:46.583
Dr. Banner? Is that you?

1117
01:19:47.500 --> 01:19:49.667
Spider-Man. What happened?

1118
01:19:49.833 --> 01:19:50.833
Where am I?

1119
01:19:51.167 --> 01:19:52.750
-Hey. hey. hey.
-Did I do all this?

1120
01:19:52.917 --> 01:19:54.083
-You... 
-Did I hurt anyone?

1121
01:19:54.417 --> 01:19:56.833
It's not your fault. She was in your mind.
You weren't in control.

1122
01:19:57.000 --> 01:19:58.833
-I lost my inhibitor.
-Look here. here.

1123
01:19:59.083 --> 01:20:01.167
It's the only thing
keeping the monster inside.

1124
01:20:01.333 --> 01:20:03.083
It's okay. I got another one here.
I just need you to put this on.

1125
01:20:03.333 --> 01:20:04.917
-What is it?
-It's universal.

1126
01:20:05.083 --> 01:20:06.333
It should work on you.

1127
01:20:15.833 --> 01:20:18.167
Please. sir. there's people in the building.
Just put it on.

1128
01:20:21.917 --> 01:20:22.917
You okay?

1129
01:20:23.083 --> 01:20:26.250
My head. I think she broke something!

1130
01:20:26.417 --> 01:20:27.667
Is she still in there?

1131
01:20:29.083 --> 01:20:30.250
It's the other guy.

1132
01:20:30.417 --> 01:20:33.250
Bruce? Look. I can get you out of here. okay?

1133
01:20:33.500 --> 01:20:34.833
I just need you
to put that inhibitor on.

1134
01:20:35.000 --> 01:20:36.167
Get away from me!

1135
01:20:38.000 --> 01:20:38.333
He's coming.

1136
01:20:40.083 --> 01:20:41.333
I can't control.

1137
01:20:42.167 --> 01:20:43.750
Yes. you can. Bruce! Yes. you can!

1138
01:20:44.000 --> 01:20:47.250
Get out of the building!

1139
01:20:47.500 --> 01:20:48.917
Get everyone out of the...

1140
01:20:52.833 --> 01:20:54.500
No! No!

1141
01:20:54.750 --> 01:20:56.417
Banner. please. Look at me.

1142
01:20:59.083 --> 01:21:01.833
No Banner. No girl.

1143
01:21:03.250 --> 01:21:05.000
Only Hulk.

1144
01:21:14.833 --> 01:21:16.500
I didn't know you could get that big.

1145
01:21:22.583 --> 01:21:23.833
Good luck with that. Peter.

1146
01:21:33.083 --> 01:21:34.000
There you are.

1147
01:21:35.750 --> 01:21:36.667
Just hold still. Just hold still...

1148
01:21:50.500 --> 01:21:51.500
Oh. God.

1149
01:22:06.250 --> 01:22:07.250
No lethal rounds.

1150
01:22:20.250 --> 01:22:22.000
Tracking time to detonation.

1151
01:22:50.917 --> 01:22:52.667
Ninety seconds to detonation.

1152
01:22:52.917 --> 01:22:53.833
I know! I know!

1153
01:22:59.500 --> 01:23:00.833
Come on.

1154
01:23:01.000 --> 01:23:02.333
Why is your skin so thick?

1155
01:23:02.500 --> 01:23:03.750
Inhibitor cannot attach.

1156
01:23:03.917 --> 01:23:04.917
Come on!

1157
01:23:43.833 --> 01:23:44.750
Dr. Banner...

1158
01:23:46.167 --> 01:23:47.250
please.

1159
01:23:48.917 --> 01:23:49.750
Bruce.

1160
01:23:51.083 --> 01:23:51.833
It's Peter.

1161
01:23:53.750 --> 01:23:55.417
I'm your friend.

1162
01:24:24.750 --> 01:24:25.500
Bruce.

1163
01:24:44.833 --> 01:24:47.583
Throw down your guns.
or you'll get the next one in the head.

1164
01:24:58.917 --> 01:25:00.333
Where is she?

1165
01:25:13.833 --> 01:25:14.750
What did you...

1166
01:25:15.000 --> 01:25:16.083
It's over. Jean.

1167
01:25:31.417 --> 01:25:32.333
Sara.

1168
01:25:43.750 --> 01:25:44.833
Is that my gun?

1169
01:25:53.833 --> 01:25:56.500
Is anyone hurt? It's just me?

1170
01:25:57.500 --> 01:25:58.750
Is anyone hurt?

1171
01:26:00.333 --> 01:26:01.333
Spider-Man...

1172
01:26:04.083 --> 01:26:05.167
You saved my life.

1173
01:26:06.083 --> 01:26:07.583
And you saved God knows how many lives...

1174
01:26:07.750 --> 01:26:10.250
by making sure she didn't find
what she was looking for in there.

1175
01:26:10.500 --> 01:26:11.833
Still inside. We got her coming through.

1176
01:26:13.000 --> 01:26:14.833
Before she passed out.
she tried to say something.

1177
01:26:16.000 --> 01:26:18.583
A name. Sara.
Does that mean something to you?

1178
01:26:20.000 --> 01:26:21.667
Before you got the inhibitor on her...

1179
01:26:22.833 --> 01:26:24.750
she managed to get in my mind for a moment.

1180
01:26:26.333 --> 01:26:29.833
Sara was the name of someone
I worked closely with that recently passed.

1181
01:26:30.417 --> 01:26:31.500
I'm sorry to hear that

1182
01:26:33.000 --> 01:26:36.750
Somehow the memory of Sara
must have affected her.

1183
01:26:39.833 --> 01:26:42.500
Well. I'd love to talk to her
when she wakes up. if that's all right.

1184
01:26:42.750 --> 01:26:46.583
Of course. She'll be transferred
to our facility on Roosevelt Island.

1185
01:26:46.750 --> 01:26:49.000
Now. I'm just as eager
to get her talking as you are...

1186
01:26:49.167 --> 01:26:51.083
but let's not strain her too much in one day.

1187
01:26:51.750 --> 01:26:52.750
Yeah. of course.

1188
01:26:53.583 --> 01:26:54.750
Thank you. Spider-Man.

1189
01:26:55.000 --> 01:26:55.917
My pleasure.

1190
01:27:09.083 --> 01:27:11.250
It worked. She's in custody.

1191
01:27:11.417 --> 01:27:12.417
You're safe now.

1192
01:27:15.667 --> 01:27:16.583
You left this.

1193
01:27:24.917 --> 01:27:26.167
Did you want me to find it?

1194
01:27:28.333 --> 01:27:30.167
No. No.

1195
01:27:31.417 --> 01:27:32.417
Look. I can explain. I...

1196
01:27:32.583 --> 01:27:33.833
Can you take that off. please?

1197
01:27:37.833 --> 01:27:38.750
The mask.

1198
01:27:40.917 --> 01:27:45.417
I think I deserve to have this conversation
with "Peter Parker."

1199
01:28:11.417 --> 01:28:13.250
You came to the party
at our apartment the other night.

1200
01:28:19.833 --> 01:28:21.000
And the donut shop.

1201
01:28:23.250 --> 01:28:24.583
The year I went off to school.

1202
01:28:27.500 --> 01:28:28.583
Why didn't you tell me then?

1203
01:28:29.333 --> 01:28:30.917
I was trying to protect you.

1204
01:28:31.500 --> 01:28:34.167
Yeah. well. I've almost been killed. like.
five times in the past 24 hours...

1205
01:28:34.417 --> 01:28:35.917
so it's not really working that well.

1206
01:28:36.833 --> 01:28:38.083
I know. I'm sorry. I...

1207
01:28:39.583 --> 01:28:40.833
Were you ever gonna tell me?

1208
01:28:47.833 --> 01:28:48.750
Right.

1209
01:28:50.333 --> 01:28:52.667
So you just were gonna
make that decision for me.

1210
01:28:53.417 --> 01:28:54.417
I know. I'm sorry.

1211
01:28:54.667 --> 01:28:56.417
I don't really need you to keep saying
that you're sorry.

1212
01:28:56.583 --> 01:28:58.250
-I don't know what you want me to tell you.
-I want you to tell me...

1213
01:28:58.417 --> 01:28:59.750
why you would do this to me.

1214
01:29:05.917 --> 01:29:07.083
I lost someone.

1215
01:29:11.083 --> 01:29:13.167
And they'd still be here if it wasn't for me.

1216
01:29:18.000 --> 01:29:19.583
I didn't read you that letter because...

1217
01:29:20.917 --> 01:29:23.167
I didn't want anything like that
to happen to you.

1218
01:29:23.333 --> 01:29:24.417
But that's not really
your decision to make

1219
01:29:24.667 --> 01:29:25.917
I know it's not. but...

1220
01:29:28.333 --> 01:29:29.583
You mean everything to me.

1221
01:29:32.917 --> 01:29:35.250
And I've been trying to live my life
without you. but I...

1222
01:29:37.167 --> 01:29:38.167
I can't.

1223
01:29:44.417 --> 01:29:45.333
I love you.

1224
01:29:57.500 --> 01:30:00.500
This spell or whatever it is that you did...

1225
01:30:04.250 --> 01:30:05.167
It worked.

1226
01:30:08.167 --> 01:30:11.417
All these memories that you're saying
that we have together. I don't...

1227
01:30:13.667 --> 01:30:14.750
I don't have them. 1

1228
01:30:18.583 --> 01:30:20.750
And I do see why. you know.
she would love you...

1229
01:30:20.917 --> 01:30:23.500
the girl you wrote that letter to. but...

1230
01:30:28.333 --> 01:30:29.333
I understand...

1231
01:30:30.417 --> 01:30:33.333
that you did what you had to do
to protect her.

1232
01:30:35.667 --> 01:30:38.333
And for that I'm so grateful.

1233
01:30:41.833 --> 01:30:42.833
But I...

1234
01:30:46.917 --> 01:30:48.167
I don't love you.

1235
01:30:52.583 --> 01:30:53.583
Because I don't...

1236
01:30:54.167 --> 01:30:55.750
I don't even know you.

1237
01:31:04.500 --> 01:31:06.833
I should probably go now.

1238
01:31:13.250 --> 01:31:14.750
I really am sorry. Peter.

1239
01:31:33.083 --> 01:31:34.250
I don't have a phone.

1240
01:31:37.500 --> 01:31:38.833
Do you mind taking me home?

1241
01:31:41.667 --> 01:31:42.667
Yeah. of course.

1242
01:31:42.833 --> 01:31:43.833
Thank you.

1243
01:32:26.750 --> 01:32:28.250
-Thank you.
-Yeah. sure.

1244
01:32:29.500 --> 01:32:30.500
I'm going to...

1245
01:32:30.667 --> 01:32:32.167
Yeah. yeah. Yeah. of course.

1246
01:32:41.667 --> 01:32:42.750
Do you wanna come up?

1247
01:32:44.917 --> 01:32:47.167
Just to say hi to Ned. Maybe.

1248
01:32:50.583 --> 01:32:51.583
I would love that.

1249
01:32:52.667 --> 01:32:53.417
Okay.

1250
01:32:53.667 --> 01:32:56.750
The Hulk. a.k.a. Dr. Bruce Banner.
is in custody...

1251
01:32:57.000 --> 01:32:59.167
currently being transferred
to a psychiatric ward.

1252
01:32:59.500 --> 01:33:00.333
So sad

1253
01:33:00.583 --> 01:33:02.667
After years as a peaceful academic...

1254
01:33:02.917 --> 01:33:05.667
the question the world asked today is...

1255
01:33:05.833 --> 01:33:07.250
"What finally snapped?"

1256
01:33:13.667 --> 01:33:15.167
Hey. I'm nearby.

1257
01:33:15.500 --> 01:33:17.083
-Hey. I'm nearby.
-MJ?

1258
01:33:17.250 --> 01:33:18.917
-Yeah.
-Hey. I'm nearby.

1259
01:33:19.750 --> 01:33:20.750
Hey. I'm nearby.

1260
01:33:21.083 --> 01:33:22.083
You're not gonna believe this...

1261
01:33:22.250 --> 01:33:24.083
-Hey. I'm nearby.
-...but the Spidey Tracker app...

1262
01:33:24.250 --> 01:33:25.250
-...says that Spider-Man...
-Hey. I'm nearby.

1263
01:33:25.500 --> 01:33:27.500
-...is in the direct vicinity.
-Hey. I'm nearby.

1264
01:33:27.667 --> 01:33:29.333
-Oh. yeah? No way. That's crazy.
-Hey. I'm nearby.

1265
01:33:30.083 --> 01:33:31.417
Hey. I'm nearby.

1266
01:33:32.667 --> 01:33:34.583
Ned. Spider-Man. Spider-Man. Ned.

1267
01:33:35.083 --> 01:33:36.167
It's nice to meet you. Ned.

1268
01:33:36.417 --> 01:33:36.667
Hello.

1269
01:33:38.083 --> 01:33:40.250
-I'm not. like. a weirdo or anything. I'm...
-He's a little weird.

1270
01:33:40.500 --> 01:33:42.917
Why are you here?

1271
01:33:44.000 --> 01:33:44.333
-1...
-I was...

1272
01:33:45.250 --> 01:33:47.417
-I was on a subway platform.
-She was in the... Platform. Right.

1273
01:33:47.583 --> 01:33:49.417
-And she was on her phone.
-Yeah. and... Yeah. I got a little distracted.

1274
01:33:49.667 --> 01:33:50.667
-And the train was coming and he...
-I mean...

1275
01:33:50.917 --> 01:33:52.000
And I just swooped her right up.

1276
01:33:52.167 --> 01:33:53.667
-Yep. Saved me.
-Yeah.

1277
01:33:56.167 --> 01:33:56.917
Oh. my God.

1278
01:33:58.083 --> 01:33:59.500
Why has that never happened to me?

1279
01:34:00.083 --> 01:34:03.333
So what if you're mid-swing
and you decide you need to pee?

1280
01:34:03.583 --> 01:34:05.000
Do you just land on top of a building?

1281
01:34:05.250 --> 01:34:06.167
What?

1282
01:34:06.417 --> 01:34:08.500
Do you drop down to ground level
and run into a coffee shop and you're like...

1283
01:34:08.750 --> 01:34:09.833
"Hey. it's Spider-Man. I need to pee"?

1284
01:34:10.083 --> 01:34:11.667
Or do you find a rooftop somewhere?

1285
01:34:11.917 --> 01:34:13.583
No. I don't find a rooftop somewhere. Ned.

1286
01:34:13.750 --> 01:34:15.667
Is this really
what you wanna be asking him right now?

1287
01:34:15.917 --> 01:34:17.250
Yeah. dude. come on.
you can ask me anything.

1288
01:34:17.500 --> 01:34:18.833
You wanna know how my web shooters work?

1289
01:34:19.083 --> 01:34:20.583
I mean. I already know
how the web shooters work.

1290
01:34:21.167 --> 01:34:21.917
Is that right?

1291
01:34:22.167 --> 01:34:25.000
Well. there's obviously
some sort of a shear-thinning fluid...

1292
01:34:25.167 --> 01:34:28.583
that is cycling within a chamber. right?
So it can keep its liquid form.

1293
01:34:28.833 --> 01:34:31.083
And then. when you activate it
by pressing on the triggers...

1294
01:34:31.333 --> 01:34:32.750
it runs through a Teflon turbine...

1295
01:34:33.000 --> 01:34:36.667
and then it hardens
when it interacts with the air. Right?

1296
01:34:39.667 --> 01:34:41.583
I mean. not exactly. but...

1297
01:34:41.833 --> 01:34:44.000
Okay. okay. well. then tell me
what's in the web fluid.

1298
01:34:44.167 --> 01:34:47.250
I would guess something
like a long chain polymer

1299
01:34:47.417 --> 01:34:48.417
Nylon?

1300
01:34:48.583 --> 01:34:49.583
That's pretty close.

1301
01:34:49.750 --> 01:34:52.667
Okay. okay. What about Nomex or Kevlar?

1302
01:34:55.250 --> 01:34:57.083
"All right. then. Keep your secrets."

1303
01:34:57.250 --> 01:35:00.167
"If you're referring
to the incident with the dragon...

1304
01:35:00.333 --> 01:35:01.583
"I was barely involved."

1305
01:35:01.833 --> 01:35:05.333
"All I did was simply give your uncle
a little nudge out the door."

1306
01:35:07.917 --> 01:35:09.000
Solid reference.

1307
01:35:10.750 --> 01:35:11.833
Banh mi time.

1308
01:35:12.000 --> 01:35:13.250
You ordered banh mis?

1309
01:35:13.500 --> 01:35:14.583
I ordered five banh mis.

1310
01:35:14.750 --> 01:35:16.667
We have Spider-Man in the apartment.
He's gonna get fed.

1311
01:35:20.333 --> 01:35:23.250
Sorry about him. He's just. like.
very excited that you're here.

1312
01:35:23.417 --> 01:35:25.750
You kidding? This is. like.
the most fun I've had in years.

1313
01:35:26.417 --> 01:35:27.917
I really missed you guys.

1314
01:35:29.833 --> 01:35:31.750
You guys really do look like best friends.

1315
01:35:31.917 --> 01:35:32.917
What do you mean?

1316
01:35:42.500 --> 01:35:43.417
You should tell him.

1317
01:35:44.250 --> 01:35:45.167
He can handle it.

1318
01:35:47.083 --> 01:35:48.000
Yeah. I know.

1319
01:35:55.250 --> 01:35:58.500
When she was inhabiting you on the rooftop...

1320
01:36:00.000 --> 01:36:01.167
she kissed me...

1321
01:36:02.250 --> 01:36:03.750
and I kissed her back...

1322
01:36:03.917 --> 01:36:06.333
because I thought it was you.
but I didn't know.

1323
01:36:07.167 --> 01:36:08.917
And I'm really sorry.

1324
01:36:10.333 --> 01:36:11.583
I just thought you should know.

1325
01:36:14.083 --> 01:36:15.000
Thanks for telling me.

1326
01:36:18.667 --> 01:36:21.333
I mean. it's not like
I remember anything anyway. so...

1327
01:36:22.833 --> 01:36:23.750
Really?

1328
01:36:24.000 --> 01:36:26.667
Yeah. It was weird. it was like.
one second I was sitting at my desk.

1329
01:36:26.917 --> 01:36:28.667
and the next second
I was lying on the street.

1330
01:36:29.583 --> 01:36:31.083
I don't know. like a light switch went off.

1331
01:36:33.667 --> 01:36:34.583
What?

1332
01:36:34.833 --> 01:36:36.167
So you don't remember anything?

1333
01:36:38.250 --> 01:36:39.250
No. Why?

1334
01:36:39.417 --> 01:36:42.167
Metzger said he remembered
thinking about someone named Sara...

1335
01:36:42.333 --> 01:36:45.583
but what you're saying
is that you don't remember anything at all?

1336
01:36:47.750 --> 01:36:50.000
I mean. yeah. it was instantaneous.

1337
01:36:50.167 --> 01:36:51.333
That's what made it so scary.

1338
01:36:53.417 --> 01:36:54.583
He lied to me.

1339
01:36:57.667 --> 01:36:59.250
I heard you caught leshy.

1340
01:36:59.417 --> 01:37:00.250
Yeah. Her name's Jean Grey.

1341
01:37:00.667 --> 01:37:02.917
I need some help
determining the size of some potatoes.

1342
01:37:03.167 --> 01:37:04.833
-Potatoes?
-I think that's Black Widow

1343
01:37:05.000 --> 01:37:06.833
I think Metzger lied to me about a name.

1344
01:37:07.083 --> 01:37:10.583
Can you see if there's a connection
between Jean and someone named Sara?

1345
01:37:11.750 --> 01:37:13.417
These potatoes sound meager.

1346
01:37:15.083 --> 01:37:16.750
Wow. That really is your office.

1347
01:37:17.500 --> 01:37:18.500
Well. well. well.

1348
01:37:18.667 --> 01:37:20.917
Internet. government records...

1349
01:37:21.167 --> 01:37:25.750
and a lot of data related to Jean Grey
has been scrubbed by Damage Control.

1350
01:37:26.000 --> 01:37:26.917
Data about what?

1351
01:37:27.917 --> 01:37:28.917
Her sister.

1352
01:37:29.583 --> 01:37:31.000
Wait. Jean has a sister?

1353
01:37:33.667 --> 01:37:34.583
Sara Grey.

1354
01:37:34.833 --> 01:37:36.250
Also a telepath.

1355
01:37:36.500 --> 01:37:40.167
Damage Control took her into custody
for study and observation.

1356
01:37:40.417 --> 01:37:42.500
Wow. I mean. you can probably guess
what they mean by that.

1357
01:37:42.667 --> 01:37:44.833
Experimentation
and other human rights violations.

1358
01:37:45.083 --> 01:37:46.750
Yes. exactly. Wait. who are you?

1359
01:37:47.750 --> 01:37:48.500
-Hi. Ned Leeds. Big fan.
-I'm...

1360
01:37:48.833 --> 01:37:50.250
Hi.

1361
01:37:50.250 --> 01:37:51.167
I'm sorry.

1362
01:37:51.667 --> 01:37:54.667
I'm just so happy
that the sad man has friends.

1363
01:37:56.833 --> 01:37:59.000
Thanks. I owe you one.

1364
01:38:00.167 --> 01:38:01.333
Good luck. Spider-Man.

1365
01:38:01.583 --> 01:38:02.000
Bye.

1366
01:38:02.667 --> 01:38:03.917
She was just looking for her sister...

1367
01:38:04.250 --> 01:38:06.250
and I handed her to the people that took her.

1368
01:38:06.417 --> 01:38:07.917
-I gotta go.
-Hey. Peter...

1369
01:38:08.167 --> 01:38:09.083
Yeah?

1370
01:38:10.167 --> 01:38:11.250
Just be careful. all right?

1371
01:38:18.917 --> 01:38:20.583
Spider-Man's name is Peter?

1372
01:38:34.250 --> 01:38:36.583
Jean. who do you want to be?

1373
01:38:39.750 --> 01:38:40.417
Her. Pink jacket.

1374
01:38:42.083 --> 01:38:43.083
She's too far.

1375
01:38:44.167 --> 01:38:45.167
You're gonna have to hop.

1376
01:38:45.417 --> 01:38:46.500
Hop?

1377
01:38:46.667 --> 01:38:48.667
First. pick someone close.

1378
01:38:49.667 --> 01:38:50.333
And then...

1379
01:39:04.583 --> 01:39:05.583
Each hop has a limit.

1380
01:39:06.250 --> 01:39:09.417
But you can string them together
and go as far as you want.

1381
01:39:12.667 --> 01:39:13.917
You're right back where you started.

1382
01:39:15.167 --> 01:39:17.417
Could you do that
to everyone in this park at once?

1383
01:39:18.333 --> 01:39:19.667
Well. yeah. maybe one day.

1384
01:39:20.417 --> 01:39:21.583
If you get really good.

1385
01:39:35.250 --> 01:39:36.167
How could she just...

1386
01:39:40.167 --> 01:39:41.417
She wasn't really a mom

1387
01:39:44.833 --> 01:39:46.833
She was. before we changed.

1388
01:39:48.917 --> 01:39:49.833
then you're not a mom.

1389
01:39:50.833 --> 01:39:52.917
What would you do
if you had daughters like us?

1390
01:39:53.417 --> 01:39:54.417
I'd love them.

1391
01:39:58.083 --> 01:39:59.750
-Especially the redhead one.
-Shut up.

1392
01:40:02.583 --> 01:40:03.917
We have each other.

1393
01:40:07.750 --> 01:40:08.417
And we have ice cream.

1394
01:40:11.250 --> 01:40:12.583
-One mint chip. one chocolate?
-Yeah.

1395
01:40:19.167 --> 01:40:19.750
Okay.

1396
01:40:21.583 --> 01:40:23.083
Now I know how you're playing.

1397
01:40:40.667 --> 01:40:43.083
-Get down! 
-Get down!

1398
01:40:43.333 --> 01:40:45.167
Get down on the ground now!
-Get down! Get down!

1399
01:40:47.333 --> 01:40:48.583
-Down!
-Sara!

1400
01:40:54.167 --> 01:40:55.250
I'm sorry. Jean.

1401
01:40:56.417 --> 01:40:57.833
I have to keep you safe.

1402
01:41:40.333 --> 01:41:43.417
Subject is awake. Heart rate is 94 bpm.

1403
01:41:46.250 --> 01:41:49.833
Jean. that's not gonna work anymore.
thanks to Spider-Man.

1404
01:41:53.333 --> 01:41:54.250
Jean?

1405
01:42:03.833 --> 01:42:04.917
I need you to breathe.

1406
01:42:05.167 --> 01:42:06.750
I need you to look at me and breathe.

1407
01:42:07.333 --> 01:42:08.417
Okay?

1408
01:42:08.667 --> 01:42:10.083
You're safe. Breathe.

1409
01:42:12.750 --> 01:42:13.917
Where is she?

1410
01:42:15.333 --> 01:42:17.083
Like your sister.
you've been blessed with a power...

1411
01:42:17.333 --> 01:42:20.083
that has the potential
to do tremendous good in the world...

1412
01:42:20.833 --> 01:42:22.167
or tremendous damage.

1413
01:42:23.167 --> 01:42:27.167
A power like yours in the hands of a child
is an impossible burden.

1414
01:42:27.833 --> 01:42:28.917
But imagine...

1415
01:42:30.083 --> 01:42:32.417
if that power was placed
in the hands of people...

1416
01:42:32.583 --> 01:42:33.917
who actually know what to do with it.

1417
01:42:42.917 --> 01:42:44.667
Where is my sister?

1418
01:42:47.583 --> 01:42:49.500
You're gonna change the world. Jean.

1419
01:42:49.917 --> 01:42:50.917
Hey!

1420
01:42:51.667 --> 01:42:52.667
Hey!

1421
01:43:16.333 --> 01:43:17.583
I know where you are. what you're doing.

1422
01:43:17.750 --> 01:43:18.833
Oh. yeah? And how's that?

1423
01:43:19.500 --> 01:43:20.750
I got eyes everywhere. kid.

1424
01:43:22.417 --> 01:43:24.750
Look. Frank.
Damage Control kidnapped Jean's sister.

1425
01:43:25.000 --> 01:43:27.417
Jean was just trying to find her.
We were wrong about everything.

1426
01:43:27.667 --> 01:43:29.000
Sentimental horseshit.

1427
01:43:29.917 --> 01:43:31.917
You've seen what she can do
and what she's capable of.

1428
01:43:32.083 --> 01:43:34.583
What. you're gonna let her loose?
Is that what you're gonna do?

1429
01:43:35.833 --> 01:43:39.333
I'll tell you right now. you do that.
I handle it my way.

1430
01:43:39.833 --> 01:43:41.333
Frank. please. can you just...

1431
01:43:41.667 --> 01:43:42.750
Frank!

1432
01:43:55.333 --> 01:43:56.333
Distance check?

1433
01:43:56.500 --> 01:43:57.667
Forty-foot clearance.

1434
01:43:57.833 --> 01:43:59.167
Locking down the room.

1435
01:43:59.333 --> 01:44:00.167
Locking down.

1436
01:44:05.667 --> 01:44:06.583
Disengage inhibitor.

1437
01:44:11.167 --> 01:44:13.250
Jean. your powers are now fully operational.

1438
01:44:22.833 --> 01:44:25.667
As you can tell.
we are beyond your jump radius.

1439
01:44:27.083 --> 01:44:28.750
Tell me what V-Max is.

1440
01:44:29.583 --> 01:44:31.250
You're the second person
to ask me about that.

1441
01:44:32.333 --> 01:44:33.750
I have no idea what that means.

1442
01:44:34.000 --> 01:44:35.500
She sent me a message.

1443
01:44:36.167 --> 01:44:37.917
She was trying to help me find her.

1444
01:44:38.917 --> 01:44:42.333
She communicated with you telepathically
across all that distance?

1445
01:44:42.833 --> 01:44:45.833
We did register a huge spike in that session.

1446
01:44:47.667 --> 01:44:48.667
Fascinating.

1447
01:44:48.833 --> 01:44:51.083
What does it mean?

1448
01:44:52.750 --> 01:44:53.750
I don't know.

1449
01:44:54.750 --> 01:44:56.083
Let's begin.

1450
01:45:04.250 --> 01:45:06.417
Our work with Sara centered on two areas...

1451
01:45:06.667 --> 01:45:08.833
identifying the source of her power...

1452
01:45:09.000 --> 01:45:11.917
and identifying a path towards copying it.

1453
01:45:12.083 --> 01:45:15.917
If we could find a way to record
a telepathic brain during a jump...

1454
01:45:16.167 --> 01:45:18.917
then perhaps we could replicate
those pathways...

1455
01:45:19.167 --> 01:45:20.833
in a mind of our choosing.

1456
01:45:22.333 --> 01:45:25.417
This instrument is your sister's legacy.

1457
01:45:26.583 --> 01:45:29.500
We built this together
over many months of trial and error.

1458
01:45:30.667 --> 01:45:32.833
I hope you and I can honor her sacrifice.

1459
01:45:36.000 --> 01:45:37.250
What are you talking about?

1460
01:45:38.833 --> 01:45:40.083
Trigger the first jump.

1461
01:45:44.833 --> 01:45:47.250
Tell me what V-Max is.

1462
01:45:47.417 --> 01:45:49.000
I know that's where you're hiding her.

1463
01:46:04.333 --> 01:46:05.250
She's jumping.

1464
01:46:07.583 --> 01:46:08.250
Copy.

1465
01:46:09.083 --> 01:46:12.000
We're in full lockdown.
Process has commenced.

1466
01:46:12.167 --> 01:46:13.000
What process?

1467
01:46:14.667 --> 01:46:17.000
Hey. whoa.
that's a pretty serious look there. dude.

1468
01:46:17.833 --> 01:46:19.250
Hey. hey. whoa! What the hell. man?

1469
01:46:19.500 --> 01:46:21.500
Come on. I'm a friend of Damage Control.
What are you doin'?

1470
01:46:26.083 --> 01:46:27.583
It's gonna be like that. You wanna go.

1471
01:46:27.833 --> 01:46:28.750
All right.

1472
01:46:29.250 --> 01:46:30.750
All right. well. just give me a sec.

1473
01:46:31.333 --> 01:46:32.250
Give me a sec.

1474
01:46:33.167 --> 01:46:34.667
I'm not in high school anymore.

1475
01:46:36.917 --> 01:46:38.417
Do you stretch? You a big stretcher?

1476
01:46:38.583 --> 01:46:39.833
I mean. you should do it
in your line of work

1477
01:46:40.500 --> 01:46:43.667
What about you? You guys stretch?
It's so good for you.

1478
01:46:45.333 --> 01:46:46.250
You ready?

1479
01:46:55.917 --> 01:46:56.833
Watch your head!

1480
01:47:16.750 --> 01:47:18.500
Where is Jean Grey?

1481
01:47:19.583 --> 01:47:21.167
That's jump 26.

1482
01:47:21.417 --> 01:47:22.500
Recordings look good.

1483
01:47:22.750 --> 01:47:23.833
Excuse me. sir.

1484
01:47:24.750 --> 01:47:25.833
We have an intruder.

1485
01:47:30.917 --> 01:47:32.167
You were right.

1486
01:47:32.333 --> 01:47:34.250
She's much stronger than her sister.

1487
01:47:35.250 --> 01:47:36.500
Increase the frequency.

1488
01:47:38.000 --> 01:47:39.333
You're doing very well. Jean.

1489
01:48:27.250 --> 01:48:28.500
Jean?

1490
01:48:33.000 --> 01:48:34.083
Jean. can you hear me?

1491
01:48:40.583 --> 01:48:41.583
Jean?

1492
01:48:46.167 --> 01:48:47.417
You're a murderer.

1493
01:48:49.750 --> 01:48:52.667
Her frequencies are evolving.

1494
01:48:52.917 --> 01:48:54.083
This doesn't make sense.

1495
01:48:55.083 --> 01:48:59.167
The last thing my sister saw was this room.

1496
01:48:59.333 --> 01:49:02.167
Her brainwaves are somehow
affecting the objects around her.

1497
01:49:03.250 --> 01:49:04.250
I'm trying. sir.

1498
01:49:04.417 --> 01:49:05.417
What do you mean you're trying?

1499
01:49:05.917 --> 01:49:10.917
The last thing my sister saw
was this goddamn room!

1500
01:49:11.083 --> 01:49:13.000
-Shut it down!
-I can't. sir.

1501
01:49:14.250 --> 01:49:15.083
Move.

1502
01:49:17.500 --> 01:49:19.417
I can't let you do that. Bill.

1503
01:49:23.167 --> 01:49:27.167
The only hands that will wield this power...

1504
01:49:28.250 --> 01:49:29.750
are mine.

1505
01:51:42.333 --> 01:51:43.917
-What...
-What do you want?

1506
01:51:47.333 --> 01:51:50.250
Jean. I'm here to help you.

1507
01:51:51.583 --> 01:51:53.000
You put me here

1508
01:51:53.917 --> 01:51:57.917
I know. and I'm sorry about Sara.
and I'm sorry that I got it so wrong.

1509
01:52:00.250 --> 01:52:01.167
If you came here...

1510
01:52:01.417 --> 01:52:04.583
to save a helpless girl from Damage Control.
you're too late.

1511
01:52:05.667 --> 01:52:07.417
They're the ones who need saving.

1512
01:52:07.583 --> 01:52:08.667
And now...

1513
01:52:12.917 --> 01:52:13.667
Here we go.

1514
01:52:28.417 --> 01:52:29.833
God. that's cool.

1515
01:52:50.917 --> 01:52:52.917
Jean! Jean. please!

1516
01:53:07.250 --> 01:53:08.833
Come on! Come on! Come on!

1517
01:53:29.583 --> 01:53:30.667
What?

1518
01:53:32.750 --> 01:53:33.583
Isn't it funny...

1519
01:53:33.750 --> 01:53:37.167
how your friends from Damage Control
developed a special weapon.

1520
01:53:37.250 --> 01:53:38.417
just for you?

1521
01:53:39.750 --> 01:53:42.333
They've got a whole task force ready.

1522
01:53:42.500 --> 01:53:44.333
Just in case you ever get out of line.

1523
01:53:48.833 --> 01:53:50.250
People are monsters.

1524
01:53:55.250 --> 01:53:58.417
You shouldn't trust them
any more than they trust you.

1525
01:54:12.000 --> 01:54:13.083
I'm a little busy. Frank.

1526
01:54:13.250 --> 01:54:14.500
We got a problem. kid.

1527
01:54:14.750 --> 01:54:17.333
She got ahold of everyone
within a kilometer of the island.

1528
01:54:18.000 --> 01:54:19.000
Wait. what?

1529
01:54:25.000 --> 01:54:27.167
Hey. look. if you're gonna do something.
you better do it now.

1530
01:54:27.333 --> 01:54:28.417
I'm trying!

1531
01:54:54.000 --> 01:54:55.333
Kid?

1532
01:54:55.500 --> 01:54:57.250
Shit! Goddamn it.

1533
01:55:31.167 --> 01:55:32.167
My sister died...

1534
01:55:32.417 --> 01:55:33.667
in this room...

1535
01:55:35.000 --> 01:55:36.667
surrounded by these men.

1536
01:55:38.000 --> 01:55:39.083
And her only crime...

1537
01:55:39.250 --> 01:55:40.833
was that she was special.

1538
01:55:42.667 --> 01:55:43.833
Just like you.

1539
01:55:49.167 --> 01:55:52.167
People like us
don't get to live a normal life.

1540
01:55:55.167 --> 01:55:58.333
We don't get to have friends or a family.

1541
01:56:00.333 --> 01:56:01.667
Those people are gone.

1542
01:56:04.500 --> 01:56:06.167
That life is over.

1543
01:56:32.333 --> 01:56:34.750
So why don't you just
be honest with yourself?

1544
01:56:37.750 --> 01:56:39.083
Are you Peter Parker?

1545
01:56:41.250 --> 01:56:42.583
Or are you Spider-Man?

1546
01:57:15.583 --> 01:57:16.583
I'm both.

1547
01:59:01.333 --> 01:59:03.333
Jean. please. -

1548
01:59:04.583 --> 01:59:06.000
This won't make it right.

1549
01:59:08.167 --> 01:59:10.000
Come on. You're not a killer. Jean.

1550
01:59:10.167 --> 01:59:11.417
You have no idea what I am.

1551
01:59:13.167 --> 01:59:14.833
I know that you loved your sister.

1552
01:59:18.167 --> 01:59:21.000
And I know that losing her
felt like you'd lost everything.

1553
01:59:21.167 --> 01:59:24.167
If you come any closer. he dies! They all do!

1554
01:59:42.417 --> 01:59:43.833
You know this won't bring her back.
right. Jean?

1555
01:59:44.000 --> 01:59:45.000
You...

1556
02:00:01.667 --> 02:00:03.750
Don't be so sure I can't get into your mind.

1557
02:00:05.917 --> 02:00:08.167
I'm a lot more powerful since I last tried.

1558
02:00:18.333 --> 02:00:19.583
Go ahead.

1559
02:00:31.000 --> 02:00:32.250
Hey.

1560
02:00:34.333 --> 02:00:38.000
You think you don't have to listen to me
now that you've got powers?

1561
02:00:42.667 --> 02:00:48.167
You know. this whole thing
can get really scary.

1562
02:00:48.333 --> 02:00:49.333
You know that?

1563
02:01:07.917 --> 02:01:09.500
It's already pretty scary.

1564
02:01:12.417 --> 02:01:15.250
And things can change. like. very quickly..

1565
02:01:15.417 --> 02:01:18.333
in ways that we can't even imagine right now.

1566
02:01:18.500 --> 02:01:19.500
I know.

1567
02:01:23.417 --> 02:01:25.167
I don't think you do know.

1568
02:01:27.000 --> 02:01:28.583
What do you mean?

1569
02:01:31.667 --> 02:01:33.417
You're a really special person.

1570
02:01:35.000 --> 02:01:37.917
And I would hope that that will always
make you feel really great about yourself...

1571
02:01:39.000 --> 02:01:41.750
but I know sometimes it doesn't.

1572
02:01:41.917 --> 02:01:44.333
Sometimes you'll be really lonely.

1573
02:01:48.000 --> 02:01:49.167
And sometimes...

1574
02:01:50.583 --> 02:01:52.000
because you're special...

1575
02:01:54.417 --> 02:01:58.167
people can do dark. monstrous things to you.

1576
02:02:03.000 --> 02:02:04.417
this is what I want you to know.

1577
02:02:06.417 --> 02:02:08.167
You're beautiful...

1578
02:02:08.333 --> 02:02:09.667
and the people who love you...

1579
02:02:09.833 --> 02:02:13.667
we love you not because you're special.
love you because you're you.

1580
02:02:15.833 --> 02:02:17.250
Iwant you to remember that.

1581
02:02:19.500 --> 02:02:21.500
Evenen it feels like you're totally alone.

1582
02:02:24.500 --> 02:02:26.417
That's your deepest responsibility.

1583
02:02:29.750 --> 02:02:33.000
Never forget that.
no matter how powerful you become.

1584
02:02:49.167 --> 02:02:50.250
Hey.

1585
02:03:06.000 --> 02:03:07.583
I'm sorry about your sister.

1586
02:03:12.833 --> 02:03:14.667
I'm sorry about your aunt.

1587
02:03:18.083 --> 02:03:19.333
Yeah. you would've loved her.

1588
02:03:23.167 --> 02:03:25.083
Just because we've lost someone...

1589
02:03:28.250 --> 02:03:30.250
It doesn't mean we have to do this alone.

1590
02:03:32.333 --> 02:03:35.083
I mean. we can't.

1591
02:03:35.250 --> 02:03:36.917
Trust me. I've been trying.

1592
02:03:40.167 --> 02:03:41.333
It doesn't work.

1593
02:03:46.167 --> 02:03:47.417
Even if that's true...

1594
02:03:51.750 --> 02:03:52.917
I have no one.

1595
02:03:57.667 --> 02:03:58.750
You have me.

1596
02:04:43.333 --> 02:04:44.333
Are you hurt?

1597
02:04:44.750 --> 02:04:45.833
No. I'm fine.

1598
02:04:51.750 --> 02:04:52.750
I'm okay.

1599
02:04:53.667 --> 02:04:55.083
-Peter.
-I'm okay. I'm okay. I'm okay.

1600
02:04:55.250 --> 02:04:56.333
Peter. No.

1601
02:05:00.417 --> 02:05:02.250
Peter. Peter. No. no.

1602
02:05:02.417 --> 02:05:04.250
No. no. no. Peter. Peter.

1603
02:05:05.500 --> 02:05:07.833
Jean. you gotta get outta here.
They'll be looking for you.

1604
02:05:08.000 --> 02:05:09.750
No. no. no. Please. just stay with me.

1605
02:05:09.917 --> 02:05:10.917
Come on. hold on. Come on. please!

1606
02:05:11.167 --> 02:05:12.333
Jean. you're...

1607
02:05:13.167 --> 02:05:14.667
You're gonna be okay.

1608
02:05:16.000 --> 02:05:17.000
Just go.

1609
02:05:19.167 --> 02:05:20.167
Look at me.

1610
02:05:37.917 --> 02:05:42.833
Shock today as Spider-Man anuved
alellevue Hospital with a bullet wound

1611
02:05:43.333 --> 02:05:45.000
seemingly at death's door.

1612
02:05:48.833 --> 02:05:49.750
The reclusive crime fighter
is in critical condition...

1613
02:05:49.917 --> 02:05:52.667
as the city's top medical experts
work to save him.

1614
02:05:56.333 --> 02:05:59.083
Tonight. all eyes are on Spider-Man.

1615
02:06:01.167 --> 02:06:03.500
The hero who saved New York so many times...

1616
02:06:04.000 --> 02:06:06.333
is now in the hands
of its best and brightest.

1617
02:06:09.000 --> 02:06:11.917
Arrd the people of New York hold their breath.

1618
02:07:26.333 --> 02:07:28.500
-No. no. no. Hey.
-Where's my mask?

1619
02:07:28.667 --> 02:07:30.000
Don't worry about that. Iot you covered.

1620
02:07:30.250 --> 02:07:31.167
Hey. you're good.

1621
02:07:31.583 --> 02:07:32.917
Where's Jean? Is she okay?

1622
02:07:33.083 --> 02:07:34.917
Yeah. she's okay. She's okay.

1623
02:07:35.083 --> 02:07:36.250
-Where is she?
-Kid.

1624
02:07:37.583 --> 02:07:39.167
I think maybe she just left.

1625
02:07:40.417 --> 02:07:45.083
She was using her magic voodoo shit
to keep you alive.

1626
02:07:55.500 --> 02:07:56.500
I'm sorry.

1627
02:08:01.333 --> 02:08:04.417
-Frank. Frank. it's okay.
-Just. I'm really sorry for what I did.

1628
02:08:04.667 --> 02:08:06.167
-No. Frank. it's okay.
-And it's. no. it's a lot of things...

1629
02:08:06.500 --> 02:08:08.333
but it sure as shit ain't okay. all right?

1630
02:08:12.000 --> 02:08:13.000
I've seen...

1631
02:08:14.833 --> 02:08:18.417
I've seen real bravery. kid. in my day.

1632
02:08:20.167 --> 02:08:21.167
But that...

1633
02:08:22.583 --> 02:08:24.000
What was something else

1634
02:08:27.500 --> 02:08:28.667
You crying. Frank?

1635
02:08:28.917 --> 02:08:30.417
No. I ain't...

1636
02:08:37.167 --> 02:08:39.083
You know. you look the exact way
I thought you would.

1637
02:08:41.667 --> 02:08:42.750
A nice kid.

1638
02:08:45.333 --> 02:08:46.583
Never had a friend like that.

1639
02:08:57.000 --> 02:08:58.417
I can't believe I just saw you cry.

1640
02:08:58.583 --> 02:09:00.583
I didn't cry. What are you talking about?

1641
02:09:01.583 --> 02:09:01.833
Bullshit.

1642
02:09:04.167 --> 02:09:05.583
Yeah. this.

1643
02:09:06.083 --> 02:09:07.333
They've been doing it all night.

1644
02:09:07.500 --> 02:09:10.000
They've been here since you walked in.
Just take a look.

1645
02:09:20.833 --> 02:09:23.667
Yo. kid. when you came in.
they had to cut through the suit...

1646
02:09:23.833 --> 02:09:25.917
but when you're ready to split...

1647
02:09:27.167 --> 02:09:28.250
I got a plan.

1648
02:09:30.167 --> 02:09:34.667
Dr. Moseley. 2495.

1649
02:09:50.167 --> 02:09:52.083
Hey. it's Spider-Man!

1650
02:09:54.667 --> 02:09:56.083
Spider-Man!

1651
02:10:03.583 --> 02:10:05.000
Yeah. Spider-Man!

1652
02:10:06.417 --> 02:10:08.167
You're the best. Spider-Man!

1653
02:10:09.250 --> 02:10:10.500
Spider-Man!

1654
02:10:14.417 --> 02:10:15.583
We love you!

1655
02:10:49.750 --> 02:10:53.833
Spider-Man! Spider-Man! Spider-Man!

1656
02:11:09.167 --> 02:11:13.083
Spider-Man! Spider-Man! Spider-Man!

1657
02:12:23.083 --> 02:12:27.083
I've...

1658
02:12:27.083 --> 02:12:29.000
Been thinking a lot about what you said.

1659
02:12:31.583 --> 02:12:34.250
And you'd be happy to know
that I've decided I'm not...

1660
02:12:36.000 --> 02:12:37.917
I'm not gonna do this alone anymore.

1661
02:12:47.500 --> 02:12:48.667
I miss you. May.

1662
02:12:58.083 --> 02:12:59.000
I mean. I've still got a little pain
in my back..

1663
02:12:59.250 --> 02:13:02.250
but I could probably get back out there
if you need me for anything.

1664
02:13:02.417 --> 02:13:04.583
What I need you to do is rest.

1665
02:13:04.833 --> 02:13:06.750
I know. I know. but come on.
you gotta give me something.

1666
02:13:06.917 --> 02:13:08.750
I mean. how's the investigation going?

1667
02:13:08.917 --> 02:13:11.833
Well. Metzger's still missing. but...

1668
02:13:12.333 --> 02:13:14.250
your friend. Black Widow...

1669
02:13:14.500 --> 02:13:17.000
she's been helping us dig through
all the records...

1670
02:13:17.250 --> 02:13:19.250
Damage Control tried to have scrubbed.

1671
02:13:19.833 --> 02:13:22.083
Had me drop by her office the other day.

1672
02:13:22.333 --> 02:13:23.333
And how was that?

1673
02:13:23.917 --> 02:13:26.333
Well. my skin feels amazing.

1674
02:13:27.917 --> 02:13:31.083
Attention. all units.
We have a confirmed bank robbery in progress.

1675
02:13:31.250 --> 02:13:32.250
Hey. are you getting this?

1676
02:13:33.917 --> 02:13:34.917
Yeah. I'm on it.

1677
02:13:35.083 --> 02:13:37.417
Hey. it's not that far from me.
I could probably meet you down there.

1678
02:13:37.667 --> 02:13:39.833
No. We can handle a robbery.

1679
02:13:40.833 --> 02:13:43.667
Just try to take care of yourself.

1680
02:13:45.333 --> 02:13:46.250
Okay

1681
02:13:47.667 --> 02:13:48.583
You too.

1682
02:13:49.667 --> 02:13:51.000
Say hello to EJ and Marley for me.

1683
02:13:55.833 --> 02:13:57.167
Spider-Man says hello.

1684
02:14:39.750 --> 02:14:41.500
Flower guy. right. from the party?

1685
02:14:43.250 --> 02:14:44.417
I'm Peter.

1686
02:14:45.500 --> 02:14:46.833
Okay. Hello.

1687
02:15:05.417 --> 02:15:06.417
Peter.
